      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَزِيمٌ</span></b>  <i>A roaring,</i> or <i>growling:</i> a poet says,
“<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِأُسُوِدهِنَّ عَلَى الطَّرِيقِ رَزِيمُ</span><br />
”
[<i>There is,</i> or <i>was, a roaring,</i> or <i>growling, of
their lions on the road</i>]. (S.)

